  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livable, Resilient, and Water-Secure Cities Investment Program (Tranche 1)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed program will support the Government of Cambodia&amp;apos;s efforts in achieving its targeted urban and water resilience, economic growth, poverty reduction, and sustainable development goals (SDGs). It will support priority short- to long-term investments to (i) improve, expand, and sustain resilient urban areas, infrastructure, and services; (ii) promote water security in 10 cities and 2 districts across the Mekong, Tonle Sap, and coastal regions; and (iii) foster reforms and institutional strengthening of service providers</narrative>
  </description>
